Z||000007||Cheever2||01-15-2001||06:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by batboy:<BR>Get busy people, too cold to mod the Fiero, so mod your computer<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>Okay, buddy, I'll take you up on that challenge, watch out.  We're on our 3rd home puter since June: 1st one was a Compaq & dumped the motherboard within a month, got a HP and its power supply died in December.  Replaced it with a better, newer generation Compaq.  If I do a car theme, that will give me a good excuse to put my Eddie Cheever shrine in a nice visible part of our house.<BR>And now that we have a Logitech camera, we should be able to show it.  I'll keep you posted.  <BR><P>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I>||||reg||6
